WEBVTT

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:09.360
Francine is behind one of these doors.

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:12.320
In that case, let's go Minghai!

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:14.910
-Hey!
-Mingxia!

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:17.990
Her wounds must be
deeper than we thought.

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:22.370
She drank some of my blood,
but it seems it wasn't enough.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.710
I can help her out.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:29.550
Ta-da! The "Egg" medical capsule.

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.010
You brought this with you?

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:36.300
Amazing, huh? It's small,
but it can treat pretty much anything.

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:39.850
-Fatima.
-Yes?

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:44.560
Look after her for me.
And you get fixed up, too.

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:45.860
Yes.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:50.110
What's taking you so long, shiroganes?

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:53.400
Have you chickened out?

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:56.320
-Let us go then.
-All right!

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:58.830
Remember the mission.

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:03.580
If any of us get to Francine,
we destroy her.

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:09.710
The fate of mankind rests upon us.

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:24.060
Before dawn, when the stars paint the sky

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:28.900
I am searching for the thing I lost

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:33.610
With a restless heart
Under the sun yet in the dark

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:38.280
I patch together little prayers
to light my path

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:43.040
I don't need anything,
as my hands are full

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:47.830
My hands are full of emptiness

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.710
Please, just once, nod for me

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:57.430
Just once, reach out to me like the mirror

00:01:57.590 --> 00:02:02.310
I will live for that single moment,
that single second

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:07.060
All the rest can just burn away

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:11.820
What's right for me is for me alone

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:16.740
Whatever the path, I'll follow it to you

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:21.530
This feeling grows and grows,
deep inside my heart

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.120
For one single reason

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:33.170
I continue to climb up on the stage

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:42.930
#12 The faceless commander

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:44.520
It's pitch black.

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:47.600
Yeah, but I feel a draft from below.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:53.320
You can't see in this bit of darkness?

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.280
You poor plain shiroganes.

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:59.910
We don't have light-correcting eyes,
if that's what you're implying.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:02.370
Not like you shirogane-Os.

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:05.410
The name is Malina. Call me "Lina."

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:12.170
And yes, I can see.
I see sinister steps leading down to hell.

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.300
I haven't introduced myself.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.850
I'm Steve Rockenfield.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:26.060
I'm a medical professor at
a British university.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:28.940
I'm Schwarzes Tor from Germany.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:31.690
Whatever.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:37.820
It seems you have a rather low opinion
of us shiroganes.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:39.320
Yep.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:49.660
I can't forgive people
who throw away their lives like nothing.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:53.170
My precious family.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:57.670
I came here to protect them

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:01.180
by destroying the puppets
spreading ZONAPHA syndrome.

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:05.180
Please understand, Narumi.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:10.940
We're all here for a reason,
but nobody plans on dying.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:16.110
I have a fiancée waiting at home.
I'm going to marry her when I return.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:18.030
We're not like the shirogane-Os.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:22.200
That's so stupid. Family? Marriage?

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:26.490
Unnecessary feelings will
just make you scared of fighting.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:32.670
That's why we had Commander Faceless
turn us into machines.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:38.920
If you don't cherish life
or know how to cooperate, you can't win.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:43.470
Yeah, well we're not made that way.

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:50.890
Congratulations. You chose the right door.

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:53.850
Now, you may begin fighting.

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:55.270
Fighting?

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.440
That's right.

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:59.400
Lady Francine is behind that door.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:04.280
But only half of you are allowed
to go through.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:10.290
Only the two who survive a fight
among the four of you can proceed.

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:12.250
Go to hell! We won't.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:14.710
You have no choice.

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:18.000
If you try anything funny...

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:23.510
You'll die. You have 18 minutes.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:33.310
Part of the floor will crumble
every 3 minutes.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:36.020
Okay, begin.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.570
I suppose we have no choice.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:53.870
I wish we didn't have to fight each other.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:55.330
I feel you.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:02.300
To the Sahara via Japan, eh?

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:06.090
This is quite a journey, George.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:08.800
Your curiosity brought you here.

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:14.980
You could've left after taking me to
your village to pick that load up.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:19.810
I wanted to see that world
I've never seen before.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:24.110
It'll keep me from getting bored.

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:35.450
Okay, let's do this.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.460
No way.

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:42.800
What?

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.300
Only two of us can go ahead.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:47.680
We have to do as they say.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:52.140
You too? Oh, come on.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:56.140
I'll never fight just because
somebody told me to.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:59.150
-But...
-You guys go ahead.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:02.520
I will not allow that.

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:07.860
You'll all die right here, right now.
10 seconds till launch.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.240
Just go, you two.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:15.080
Why? You said so yourself.
Not to throw away our lives so easily.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:16.620
3, 2...

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:18.000
Why choose death?

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:30.760
Narumi...

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:34.050
Mr. Rockenfield, Mr. Tor.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:39.890
Not everything needs a reason.

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.360
But why?

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:46.400
I said this to somebody before.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:50.200
That if something happens,
think with your heart.

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:54.530
And here's what my heart said.

00:07:54.830 --> 00:08:00.000
The children with ZONAPHA syndrome...
Your families...

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:03.380
I just don't want them to cry.

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:11.630
Go now, and destroy Francine.

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:18.890
I've never felt so much pain before
in being a shirogane.

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:23.100
Don't worry, I'll catch up to you.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:27.150
He still hasn't given up.

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.790
I was careless.

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:44.710
I can't believe I'm going to die.

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:46.500
It's not over yet.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:52.050
When the floor crumbles,
jump onto the wall. I'll support you.

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:53.840
Dig through the wall.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.550
What do you...

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:57.600
Jump!

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:12.950
Oh, Narumi and Lina. You're alive.

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:16.700
-Glad to see you are too.
-Yeah, somehow.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:20.910
Did you do this?

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.120
No, it was them.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:26.210
Because we refused to fight each other.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:30.460
Some latecomers to the party?

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:33.300
Now you can all kill each other.

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:41.310
I don't understand this man, Faceless.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:45.100
He doesn't even blink when his people die.

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:46.480
Narumi.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:50.570
Your face has your thoughts
written all over it.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:53.190
I see you don't like me much.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:57.320
But let me set things straight.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:00.780
I have feelings, too.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:03.330
Do you know why I became a shirogane?

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:07.330
Because an automaton
took my wife away from me.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:11.340
-Hey!
-Seems like he wants to die now.

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:24.560
Dirt to dirt, ashes to ashes.

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:29.150
Detestable automata to piles of gears.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:36.030
-Wow.
-Of course.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:38.450
He's Faceless of the 3 solutions.

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:39.660
3 solutions?

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:43.370
The first is dismantle,
the second is dissolve.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:47.410
And the third?

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:53.170
Let's just say it's a secret trick
that can shut up any automaton.

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.340
Come, Timbavati.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:59.590
We need your puppet to get across.

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:01.640
Not so fast.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:07.100
-No breaking the rules.
-That's right.

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:12.230
Rule breakers will be blown to bits.

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:19.860
How long have I been out?

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:25.580
Don't worry, Narumi and the others
will destroy Francine.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:28.410
Yeah right, I'm going too.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:30.580
She's right.

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:37.170
Let's go find Francine
though a different route.

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:40.050
A different route? There's a way?

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:41.970
Of course.

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:45.060
That's what I'm waiting for.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:49.060
What's this silver smoke?

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:52.560
The helicopter can't fly straight, either.

00:11:53.110 --> 00:11:56.320
This is the source of ZONAPHA syndrome.

00:11:57.280 --> 00:12:01.070
It looks like smoke, but it's
microscopic insectoid automata.

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:03.820
I can't breathe...

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.830
The ZONAPHA got him.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:10.330
This is prohibited,
but it can't be helped.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:12.370
Hey.

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:15.250
Oops, my mistake.

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.380
What the hell...

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:20.630
I'll help you, so you must help me too.

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:31.810
I'll take on the automata, you guys go!

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:34.900
Stop acting like a big shot.

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:37.900
Blade feet, huh?

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:41.280
Don't think you can ignore me like that.

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:42.910
-Narumi!
-Timbavati.

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:45.870
Don't waste Narumi's choice.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:52.920
Okay, it's safe. Hurry.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.210
Not so fast.

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:56.500
Fire!

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.060
You're such a fool.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:14.520
-Narumi!
-What do you think you're doing?

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:17.110
Trying to make us owe you something?

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:18.690
No...

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:25.700
Sometimes I just...

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:32.410
I want to be free to choose
what's dangerous and foolish.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:35.000
That's the kind of person I want to be.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:37.040
Hurry, go!

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:38.920
You go on.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:41.840
I can't let Narumi do this by himself.

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:44.970
What are you doing? You get going too!

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.890
The Rolling Slasher's awake!

00:13:55.140 --> 00:14:00.020
Either you can be killed by me
or crushed by the Slasher.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:01.730
5 minutes, Narumi.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:04.360
Just 5 minutes will do.

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:12.950
He's trying to escape alone.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:16.370
He left you here to die.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:21.420
Who do you think I am? Guess what?

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:23.760
I was going to do it alone anyways!

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:32.010
Pretty heavy, huh?

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:42.400
Damn it.

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:47.450
It stopped.

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:58.250
You lasted the 5 minutes.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:02.790
That's why you survived.

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:08.800
You did that to save me?

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:14.060
Machines are such pitiful things.

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:18.100
It only takes a small rock like me

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:21.810
to stop the gears of such a huge machine.

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:28.740
My wife and I were childhood friends.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.200
She was so pretty.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:38.080
She was always sincere
and laughed at all of my jokes.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:45.750
I had no parents, so I was handed off
to live with different relatives.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:49.380
That's when I began to act like a jester.

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:54.850
Even when sad, I could bear it
if I fooled around.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:58.680
Yet with her...

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:04.230
I could show my true face.

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:09.280
But her mother detested me.

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:12.570
She didn't trust me.

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:16.740
So she tore us apart.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:24.540
The next time I met her,
she was the wife of an automaton.

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:29.130
I went to rescue her.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.180
But...

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:43.850
I'd pitifully survived,
but was infected with ZONAPHA.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.190
That's when Lucille came.

00:16:47.070 --> 00:16:51.150
And that's how I became a shirogane.

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:55.660
-I...
-Don't mention it.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:59.120
You just kindly listened

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:04.170
to the boring old story
of a man who lost his face.

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:07.380
Go on now.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:13.180
And destroy Doll Francine.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.680
I should put these on.

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:24.770
Without them, I tend to talk too much...

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:32.740
Rest easy.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:38.910
I will destroy Doll Francine.

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:51.130
What the hell is this?

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:55.130
Not even I have seen
this many corpses before.

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:58.930
A battle between the shiroganes
and the automata.

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:09.650
Are you okay?

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:14.860
Tor, good. You're alive.

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:18.740
Yes, but I've lost sight of
Prof. Rockenfield.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:22.700
I see, but jeez.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:26.870
It's so darn cold in here.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:31.960
And it's dark, too.

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:34.840
Narumi.

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:41.640
Lord, please protect him.

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:52.610
What's this?

00:18:55.940 --> 00:19:00.990
It seems to be a gallery
glorifying Doll Francine.

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:04.200
Looks like we have to pass through it.

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:11.000
Narumi, I must apologize to you.

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:17.170
I lied about having a fiancée.

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:19.260
What do you mean?

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:22.640
It was over 90 years ago.

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:32.150
Father... Mother...

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:35.480
Why is this happening?

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:48.250
That was the first time
I laid eyes on Doll Francine.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:53.840
She watched the people suffer
without moving a brow.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:57.630
She looked down on me like I was a bug.

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:00.880
It sent a chill down my spine.

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:06.390
Because I saw that there was nothing
inside her heart.

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:16.690
She moved on into the circle of puppets
dancing around.

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.320
And what should happen next,

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:24.450
but the hideous puppets,
the demons that spread the disease...

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:41.010
An abominable thought pierced my mind.

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.340
That she was beautiful.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:47.560
Like the Holy Mother of Hell.

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:51.310
I can't forgive myself for it.

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:54.810
The fact I thought that way
for even a second.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:21:00.860
My father, mother, and friends
all died from the disease.

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:05.450
I must destroy Doll Francine.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:10.040
I must eliminate the cause
of ZONAPHA syndrome.

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:16.380
And with it, I wish to erase my past.

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:23.880
Narumi, Tor.

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.510
You're all alive.

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:27.470
Where's Commander Faceless?

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:30.600
I see.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:37.940
Welcome. I congratulate you.
This is your final destination.

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:41.110
Let us begin.

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:42.440
Those are...

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:46.950
The four oldest and strongest automata.

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:53.710
The road to hell must be lonely
without friends.

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:58.380
Now, you will put on a show
for Lady Francine.

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:02.710
A fight with us, Les Quatre Pionniers.

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:17.020
Fly up high, Marionette

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:19.230
Turn to ash, gracefully

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:23.740
My only purpose in life was to fight

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:28.490
Why am I so angry
even I dump my humanity

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:34.870
Without you, I can't smile anymore

00:22:35.910 --> 00:22:40.040
I assume that I am to be blamed

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:44.670
Like a puppet that can't smile naturally

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:49.760
I feel like someone is pulling my strings

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:53.430
What am I even living for?

00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:57.890
I was hurt, and thought
that nobody would understand

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:02.980
But you came along,
and took me in your arms

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:09.160
I felt my tangled arms and legs

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:11.450
become free

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:13.950
Fly up high, Marionette

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:16.370
I think now I can reach you

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:20.830
Before I met you, I was empty

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:25.710
Now I have something
I'd give my all to protect

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:31.760
You taught me how to feel,
the feeling of sorrow too
